  # only - do not submit personal or confidential data". The catalogue the gateway serves without a key flags
  # each model below as one that "mayTrainOnYourPrompts". Logging and training are accepted here, as for every
  # free model of this file. The 200 are counted per IP address, so they are one pool for the whole host,
  # shared by every entry of this section and by nothing else here: a slot is a second quota next to
