  # header with "extra_headers", and the proxy then sends an empty one, which the gateway answers 200.
  # "check_compose_template.py" holds every entry on the gateway's base to that, since the 401 would
  # otherwise only show up at run time. "openai/" is cut once by LiteLLM, so the id after it, slash and
  # ":free" included, reaches the gateway whole.
