    # "whisper-large-v3-turbo", which has its own quota and a higher rate. Gemini's free transcription
    # model comes next, ahead of the paid one because it costs nothing, behind Groq because of what its
    # free tier does with the audio (see its entry above). Mistral's Voxtral is last because it is paid.
